<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Lattice Burn</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Lattice Burn</ansi> is used by the Facet Hunter. It lays a hand of light against the
wall, and thin bright lines cross the room from wall to wall, drawing
tighter over several rounds before they burn everyone between them. It
spares the Obelisk's own guardians.

